territories and then, um, DC,

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:54.310
our nation's capital,
everybody gets represented.

00:00:54.310 --> 00:00:57.280
So like there's a person
representing every state

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:00.505
every part and they all
enter in this competition.

00:01:00.505 --> 00:01:04.040
And the cool thing about it
too is that it's original songs

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.870
